{{JPExclusive}}
'''Cat Boy''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] based on the mascot of [[Battle Cats TV]]. He was added in [[Version 9.5 Update|Version 9.5]] of [[Nyanko Daisensou]]. Starting from September 19th, 2020, Cat Boy can be obtained from [https://ponos.s3.amazonaws.com/information/appli/battlecats/question/nyankoTV_202003.html this site]. He was added to celebrate the official [[Battle Cats TV]] channel getting 150,000 subscribers.

{{Cat Info
|ID = 542
|rarity = EX
|name1 = Cat Boy
|name2 = Cat Student
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Cat Student''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This young boy is sadly entirely useless outside of [[Empire of Cats]] due to low stats and no abilities. His only use is for his combo, which is pretty useless as well.

{{Job|Classification = Combo Slave}}

